Z||000000||Robert||11-24-2000||02:50 PM||||Fall finally hit my street the day after Thanksgiving.  The leaves have been turning, but today they are “Falling”.  <BR>A few years ago, my neighbors and myself got together and decided to ignore the city ordnance requiring us to trim the trees back.  The CITY has never come after us, in fact, the city now brags about how great our street is in the summer and fall. <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero_in_Fall.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Phil||11-24-2000||06:32 PM||||Looks like you have a pollen problem too- turned your car all yellow.||||reg||1
Z||000002||terryk||11-25-2000||02:19 PM||||I know the fog has over here in Roseville.||||reg||1
Z||000003||stsmithgt||11-25-2000||07:00 PM||||Hey!  Fall is a great time.  Had a good road trip up to the Pollok Pines area to cut down a tree with my brothers and folks.  My older brother and his family are hauling my tree back down to Marina for me so I don't have to get creative with strapping it to my GT.  It feels good to have the sunroof off on a cold day with the heater on cruising the streets of Sacramento checking out all the babes in their christmas outfits. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I hope everybody is having fun.  If your not, get off your a$$ and go have some! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||7
Z||000004||loafer87gt||11-25-2000||10:33 PM||||The one thing I hated about my Fiero in fall was the leaves getting jammed under the louvres in the back engine compartment. It takes quite a while to get all of the little buggers out of them.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fformula88||11-25-2000||11:54 PM||||Forget fall... I wish it was only falling LEAVES.... winter has struck buffalo!  This is a pic of my Probe in the snow storm we got monday... total of 24 inches!  (my fiero is safe and warm in the garage!)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/0001.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">   <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<p>[This message has been edited by Fformula88 (edited 11-25-2000).]||||reg||1
